From 6a2cdb2daee149922bac114fbeda525f489b142a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CustomKIMI <customkimi@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:21:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] customkimi: carry provider-reported usage.cost through
 usage totals

CloseRouter returns the authoritative USD cost of each request in usage.cost. Parse it in the Anthropic, OpenAI chat and OpenAI Responses requesters, keep it when usage patches are merged, add it up in the session usage summary, and expose it on the SDK TokenUsage type. Regenerate docs/state-manifest.d.ts for the new field.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
